{
  "info": {
    "name": "Up Leveling API",
    "description": "Hábitos gamificados: cumpra seus hábitos, ganhe XP e suba de nível.\n\n**Como usar:** rode as pastas na ordem (ou a collection inteira no Runner). O \"Cadastro\" cria um usuário novo a cada execução (e-mail com timestamp) e o \"Login\" guarda o token, usado automaticamente por todas as outras requests (auth Bearer da collection).\n\n**Produção com a conta demo:** importe o ambiente \"Up Leveling - Produção (demo)\" (pasta postman/). Com ele ativo, o Cadastro, o Atualizar perfil e o Trocar senha são pulados; o Login entra na conta demo.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "email",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "value": "senha-forte-123"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "habitId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "waterHabitId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "scheduleHabitId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Autenticação",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Cadastro",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Rodrigo\",\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.environment.get('demo') === 'true') {",
                  "  pm.execution.skipRequest(); // a conta demo já existe e não pode ter e-mail nem senha alterados",
                  "}",
                  "// E-mail novo a cada execução, para o Runner poder rodar a collection várias vezes",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('email', `rodrigo+${Date.now()}@mail.com`);"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('não devolve a senha', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.not.have.property('password'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token', pm.response.json().token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login com senha errada (401)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"senha-errada\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('401 Unauthorized', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
